From: Iltix <dev@iltix.de>
Date: Sat, 19 Apr 2026 00:00:02 +0000
Subject: Iltix Module: Theme — Liquid Glass Navigation Bar

Implements the Iltix Theme module:
- Full Apple-inspired "Liquid Glass" / Haze effect on the navigation bar:
  * Real-time backdrop blur via RenderEffect (Android 12+) / RenderNode
  * Animated liquid gradient overlay that responds to UI state
  * Semi-transparent frosted glass tinting
- Floating rounded navigation bar with margin from screen edges
- Edge-to-edge with transparent Android system bars
- Falls back gracefully on Android < 12 (simple translucent background)

The module is gated by IltixModuleManager.isThemeEnabled(). When disabled,
all UI remains 100% original Cromite behaviour.

Requires: Iltix-Module-Settings-Infrastructure.patch

